{
  "sequence_id": "seq_98544ce821c3f74b",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The presence of the cursed object! I can feel it even stronger now!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hey, you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "ZOosh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Gah! how the heck is he so fast?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "He apparently runs the so-meter dash in three seconds..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Crap!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What is he, a car?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "> Sugisawa Hospital"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "YUJi... I have some final words for you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's about your parents ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Stop, I don't care!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's about..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...your parents!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Like I said, I don't care, grandpa."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Will you stop trying to act all cool before you die?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Just be your usual self, okay?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Y- You..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Shaka Shaka"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A man wants to go out in style, you know!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You BRAT!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Don't you get it?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Don't be buying flowers all the time. Save your money."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "They're not for you. They're for the nurses."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Even more so then, you idiot!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Hey, what about your school club?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Don't go wasting your time at a sad place like this."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That's enough! My club finishes before five!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Roll"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Snap"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I wouldn't come here so often if I wasn't so bored!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "A stress- free life, huh? TCH..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "YUJI..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You're a strong kid, so..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...help people."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It doesn't have to be all the time."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T16",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Just whenever you can."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T17",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You may feel lost. Don't expect gratitude."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T18",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Just help them."
    }
  ],
